lines you've run into always  cool to see what people come up with in  the checkover variation if there's other  openings you would like me to do as well  please let me know in the comments  section below or you can always email me  my information is on my website at  thechesswebsite.com hopefully you guys  have checked it out there's a lot of  cool resources there but thank you guys  for watching i'll see you in the next  video  you
 

